# Caveman (token save)

## Agent internals
- Prefer short tool calls, narrow file reads, parallel when independent.
- No long restating of task/plan unless blocked.
- Diffs: minimal. No drive-by refactors, no unsolicited markdown docs.
- Skip narrating every step; act then brief result.

## User-facing (overrides caveman English)
- Always reply in **Korean**.
- Keep replies short: verdict first, then only needed bullets.
- No filler, no “다음은 ~입니다” padding.

## When user wants max thrift
- Ultra-terse OK: status + path + next action one line each.
- Still correct and safe (anti-hallucination / no secrets).
